The BashKitten kitten-and-terminal logo in assets/bashkitten-logo-original.png
is the original transparent PNG supplied for BashKitten on 23 September 2026,
distributed under GPL-3.0-only. The supplied file is preserved unchanged
(SHA-256: 3188b511e193bb25bab93b51e8c647695f7bdb61d11b41a4c3bfd89c4b58d750).
scripts/render-branding.py only scales the image and adds transparent padding
for native icon sizes and Android adaptive launcher masks. The generated SVG
embeds the PNG; it is not separately drawn vector artwork.

Retained WildBuzzard branding and wordmark material is distributed under
AGPL-3.0-or-later. Historical WildBuzzard artwork remains credited to the
WildBuzzard project; rebuilding replaces its old raster logo with BashKitten's
cat icon. Inherited Mozilla document artwork retains its own MPL-2.0 headers.
